        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 19-630, 8 Inch Commercial Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 8\" Center to Center (CTC)  commercial door pull is made from 1\" diameter solid stainless steel. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with Thru-Bolt mounting (Bolts through the door) for doors up to 2-1/4\" thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-19-630_size.gif?v=1704354553\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 19-630 Stainless Steel Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/10-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-20\"><b>10\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/12-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-21\"><b>12\" Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/18-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-22\"><b>18\" Door Pull</b></a> and other style <a href=\"/collections/don-jo-door-pulls\"><b>Don-Jo Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo 19-630 8\" Commercial Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-19-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262304\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 19 Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>",
